{"4133500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Guerilla Cubes", "steam_appid": 4133500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guerilla Cubes is a 1-4 player co-op arcade shooter that has you(and your friends) going on a high stakes campaign infiltrating terrorist hideouts! Its “run and gun” gameplay is filled with a bunch of weapons, perks, explosions and of course, CUBES. Gather up an elite squad or go in solo and choose from a variety of Cubes specialists all with their own quirks and talents. Be careful, though, because once you start a mission, the only way out is to finish it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/73e02cf5bec90bce3559b00ab964bcb9.avif?t=1769403640\" width=1344 height=756 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you go around the CUBE-ISH world you will encounter many unique biomes that the evil BOX-BOSS has turned into the bases for you LIBERATE! Make sure you rescue the prisoners and civilians that have gotten mixed up in this crazy world of bullets and dangerous enemies. Try to take advantage of breakable cover to get the edge on the BOX-BOSS's minions of DOOM. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/84329853c63afb762de310c9a9e2b90c.avif?t=1769403640\" width=1344 height=756 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEROES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try all 7 unique CUBE HEROES with special abilities that fit different playstyles, Want to be the medic for the team try playing as KAYABA. More of a SPEED-FREAK try SWIFT, but what if you like to gamble? Play BABAR who gets random &quot;lucky&quot; drops whenever he takes down any bad-guy!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOHNNAY -&gt; STRONG and a HARD HITTER!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SWIFT -&gt; SPEEDY and a real DODGE KING!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KAYABA -&gt; MEDICAL expert and the clear WHITE-MAGE!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BABAR -&gt; WHY not take another hand?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PANZER -&gt; a certified DEFENCE UNIT!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ELO -&gt; GRAPPLE-HOOK (everybody want's one!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REND -&gt;<strong> </strong>nothing personal kid *shink*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/26a554482fc0636fa53d22948ca2473a.avif?t=1769403640\" width=1344 height=756 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/e622e3e6b5dedad8c38e55290f18366f.poster.avif?t=1769403640\" width=614 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/e622e3e6b5dedad8c38e55290f18366f.webm?t=1769403640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The special ops squad doesn't need any weapon besides their trusty pistol to get through the lands-- after all, they are the special ops squad, but it doesn't hurt to find weapons to help them along the way. Discover unique weapons left by fallen comrades or dropped by enemies to help you throughout your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/9cfe65b42c42b2b8f4ccea18c75ac526.avif?t=1769403640\" width=1344 height=756 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MINIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOX-BOSS's minions are cunning and deadly, they will try to overwhelm you with numbers, shoot at you with high-powered sniper rifles, setup traps in close quarters, and even just run at you with full power tackle! Some minions are easy to defeat while the other can take a little more effort to figure out but the most powerful aspect of this evil force is their organization. Be carful as they can corner you into a sticky situation in which the only the BIG CUBE in the sky can help you out of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/11ca305eaf4fea0082a693752d938709.poster.avif?t=1769403640\" width=614 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/11ca305eaf4fea0082a693752d938709.webm?t=1769403640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base of operations has air-dropped unique perk machines throughout the lands you traverse to help you defeat BOX BOSS. Perk machines grant you cool and fun buffs/abilities to aid you on your journey, but each perk comes at a cost, and you can only hold so many; pick carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/720178c15e6055ab81018a12d455c313.poster.avif?t=1769403640\" width=614 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/720178c15e6055ab81018a12d455c313.webm?t=1769403640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unique hats throughout the game. Unlock them by completing in-game achievements. Selecting a hat will grant hidden and ultimate powers to your hero, turning your hero into a god untouchable by any mortal, or you can just look cool. (Equipping power-granting hats will disable achievements unless specifically stated.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/2a5d6bcb1f3ecae37e24050280764d0b.avif?t=1769403640\" width=1344 height=756 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPEED-RUNNING!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game fast to compete for the best time with friends and earn unique rewards that make you even stronger for later runs, not to mention the bragging rights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/d79b6b06e78245a8cb7d8e383300aadf.avif?t=1769403640\" width=1344 height=756 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guerilla Cubes is a 1-4 player co-op arcade shooter that has you(and your friends) going on a high stakes campaign infiltrating terrorist hideouts! Its “run and gun” gameplay is filled with a bunch of weapons, perks, explosions and of course, CUBES. Gather up an elite squad or go in solo and choose from a variety of Cubes specialists all with their own quirks and talents. Be careful, though, because once you start a mission, the only way out is to finish it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/73e02cf5bec90bce3559b00ab964bcb9.avif?t=1769403640\" width=1344 height=756 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you go around the CUBE-ISH world you will encounter many unique biomes that the evil BOX-BOSS has turned into the bases for you LIBERATE! Make sure you rescue the prisoners and civilians that have gotten mixed up in this crazy world of bullets and dangerous enemies. Try to take advantage of breakable cover to get the edge on the BOX-BOSS's minions of DOOM. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/84329853c63afb762de310c9a9e2b90c.avif?t=1769403640\" width=1344 height=756 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEROES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try all 7 unique CUBE HEROES with special abilities that fit different playstyles, Want to be the medic for the team try playing as KAYABA. More of a SPEED-FREAK try SWIFT, but what if you like to gamble? Play BABAR who gets random &quot;lucky&quot; drops whenever he takes down any bad-guy!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOHNNAY -&gt; STRONG and a HARD HITTER!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SWIFT -&gt; SPEEDY and a real DODGE KING!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KAYABA -&gt; MEDICAL expert and the clear WHITE-MAGE!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BABAR -&gt; WHY not take another hand?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PANZER -&gt; a certified DEFENCE UNIT!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ELO -&gt; GRAPPLE-HOOK (everybody want's one!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REND -&gt;<strong> </strong>nothing personal kid *shink*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/26a554482fc0636fa53d22948ca2473a.avif?t=1769403640\" width=1344 height=756 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/e622e3e6b5dedad8c38e55290f18366f.poster.avif?t=1769403640\" width=614 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/e622e3e6b5dedad8c38e55290f18366f.webm?t=1769403640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The special ops squad doesn't need any weapon besides their trusty pistol to get through the lands-- after all, they are the special ops squad, but it doesn't hurt to find weapons to help them along the way. Discover unique weapons left by fallen comrades or dropped by enemies to help you throughout your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/9cfe65b42c42b2b8f4ccea18c75ac526.avif?t=1769403640\" width=1344 height=756 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MINIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOX-BOSS's minions are cunning and deadly, they will try to overwhelm you with numbers, shoot at you with high-powered sniper rifles, setup traps in close quarters, and even just run at you with full power tackle! Some minions are easy to defeat while the other can take a little more effort to figure out but the most powerful aspect of this evil force is their organization. Be carful as they can corner you into a sticky situation in which the only the BIG CUBE in the sky can help you out of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/11ca305eaf4fea0082a693752d938709.poster.avif?t=1769403640\" width=614 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/11ca305eaf4fea0082a693752d938709.webm?t=1769403640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base of operations has air-dropped unique perk machines throughout the lands you traverse to help you defeat BOX BOSS. Perk machines grant you cool and fun buffs/abilities to aid you on your journey, but each perk comes at a cost, and you can only hold so many; pick carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/720178c15e6055ab81018a12d455c313.poster.avif?t=1769403640\" width=614 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/720178c15e6055ab81018a12d455c313.webm?t=1769403640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unique hats throughout the game. Unlock them by completing in-game achievements. Selecting a hat will grant hidden and ultimate powers to your hero, turning your hero into a god untouchable by any mortal, or you can just look cool. (Equipping power-granting hats will disable achievements unless specifically stated.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/2a5d6bcb1f3ecae37e24050280764d0b.avif?t=1769403640\" width=1344 height=756 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPEED-RUNNING!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game fast to compete for the best time with friends and earn unique rewards that make you even stronger for later runs, not to mention the bragging rights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/extras/d79b6b06e78245a8cb7d8e383300aadf.avif?t=1769403640\" width=1344 height=756 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Guerilla Cubes is an action-packed couch co-op shooter where a special ops squad battles a stupidly big army to reclaim Cube City from the ruthless BOX BOSS.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/6717079f095912fc9964690978a25496922d098a/header.jpg?t=1769403640", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133500/c9ece9af9c198494c3f2753c70c863bf557ec7ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769403640", "capsule_imagev5": "h